{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"trinket_brooch","model_identifier":"trinket_brooch","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## trinket_brooch\n\nTrinket, brooch.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.5..3.5, y -8.0..0.0, z -1.1..0.7 (size 7.0 x 8.0 x 1.8 u = 20 x 22 x 5 cm).\nBrooch: a layered cross-shaped pin (7 x 7 u): a cross of two bars, a raised square plate and a domed boss in front, four studs on the arm ends (the raised pattern), a pin behind and a small hanging ring. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: silver. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_brooch_copper.png`, `trinket_brooch_tin.png`, `trinket_brooch_bronze.png`, `trinket_brooch_iron.png`, `trinket_brooch_steel.png`, `trinket_brooch_silver.png`, `trinket_brooch_gold.png`\n"},"description":"## trinket_brooch\n\nTrinket, brooch.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.5..3.5, y -8.0..0.0, z -1.1..0.7 (size 7.0 x 8.0 x 1.8 u = 20 x 22 x 5 cm).\nBrooch: a layered cross-shaped pin (7 x 7 u): a cross of two bars, a raised square plate and a domed boss in front, four studs on the arm ends (the raised pattern), a pin behind and a small hanging ring. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: silver. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_brooch_copper.png`, `trinket_brooch_tin.png`, `trinket_brooch_bronze.png`, `trinket_brooch_iron.png`, `trinket_brooch_steel.png`, `trinket_brooch_silver.png`, `trinket_brooch_gold.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"ring","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-1.0,-0.2],"to":[0.5,0.0,0.2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[28,9,29.0,10.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[29,9,29.4,10.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[30,9,31.0,10.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[31,9,31.4,10.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,10,1.0,10.4],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[1,10,2.0,10.4],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"35823ef8-0082-5acc-bd07-2b3de367d464"},{"name":"bar_v","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,-8.0,-0.4],"to":[1.0,-1.0,0.4],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,2.0,7.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4,0,4.8,7.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[2,0,4.0,7.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[5,0,5.8,7.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[20,9,22.0,9.8],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[22,9,24.0,9.8],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"415eb2c9-e56a-5024-ba0d-6dd30e669f25"},{"name":"bar_h","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,-5.5,-0.4],"to":[3.5,-3.5,0.4],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16,0,23.0,2.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[2,7,2.8,9.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[23,0,30.0,2.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[3,7,3.8,9.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[6,7,13.0,7.8],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[13,7,20.0,7.8],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f83e31e3-39e8-5e32-bcdd-9da4672916fb"},{"name":"plate","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.75,-6.25,-0